    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush robots in a gym of gears and vapor! Fight freely in Sparring Mode or punch to the beat in Rhythm Mode to claim the throne!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm Mode: Sync your punches and blocks to the beat of pulsing music, timing your strikes and defenses to the rhythm for a fluid, high-energy fight against robotic boxers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sparring Mode: Engage in free-flowing combat in the ring, battling robotic rivals with unrestricted punches, dodges, and combos to overpower your mechanical foes.</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush robots in a gym of gears and vapor! Fight freely in Sparring Mode or punch to the beat in Rhythm Mode to claim the throne!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm Mode: Sync your punches and blocks to the beat of pulsing music, timing your strikes and defenses to the rhythm for a fluid, high-energy fight against robotic boxers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sparring Mode: Engage in free-flowing combat in the ring, battling robotic rivals with unrestricted punches, dodges, and combos to overpower your mechanical foes.</p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Step into the gritty, gear driven world of Boxing Machine VR, an exclusive virtual reality experience set in a steampunk inspired gym brimming with robotic pugilists. Your mission? Crush every opponent in the ring and rise as the undisputed champion.",
